# Copy this file to .env only for app-local public overrides.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are embedded at bundle time by Metro.
# After editing, restart the governed launcher with cache clear if required.

# Local API/transport URLs are intentionally NOT configured here.
# pnpm client/partner/captain/field routes development traffic centrally through
# tools/mobile/start-mobile-runtime.ps1:
#   LAN (default) -> BThwani Mobile Dev Gateway
#   ADB           -> verified adb reverse loopback
# Do not hardcode MACHINE_LAN_IP, 18080, 18082, 18086, 18100, or 59000 in app .env files.

# Optional. Leave unset to keep Sentry a no-op. Ask the platform owner for a project DSN.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
